            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/381020/extras/afc589742bd571f63b2cb6389b5b8190.poster.avif?t=1660334660\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/381020/extras/afc589742bd571f63b2cb6389b5b8190.webm?t=1660334660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/381020/extras/afc589742bd571f63b2cb6389b5b8190.mp4?t=1660334660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Sky Rogue é um simulador de ação aérea rogue-lite! Exploda o que encontrar pela frente, seja no ar, na terra ou no mar, em um número infinito de ilhas geradas proceduralmente. Viva combates frenéticos contra caças inimigos, ou ataque gigantescos porta-aviões voadores. Mas fique esperto com as rajadas de mísseis! Se você morrer, já era.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/381020/extras/3816f642174d60439ee4a3bc17becfbb.poster.avif?t=1660334660\" width=540 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/381020/extras/3816f642174d60439ee4a3bc17becfbb.webm?t=1660334660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/381020/extras/3816f642174d60439ee4a3bc17becfbb.mp4?t=1660334660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/381020/extras/cb952353836b7fe6153ad5df9ccdd7ce.poster.avif?t=1660334660\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/381020/extras/cb952353836b7fe6153a